## Human review

The full criteria, with their reasoning, are in [`REVIEW.md`](../REVIEW.md). Tick what you actually
reviewed; a box ticked unread is worse than an empty one.

- [ ] **API hallucinations** — methods, signatures and config keys that exist in the pinned version
- [ ] **Project fidelity** — solves the way this repo solves, without opening a second way to do the same thing
- [ ] **Tests of the spec** — verify the requirement and fail when the change is reverted
- [ ] **Technical debt** — what got worse is named; no suppression without a reason
- [ ] **Trade-offs** — the rejected alternative is stated
- [ ] **I ran the change myself** — not just watched CI go green

